1020:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** * Global variables:
1021:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  ADC_DelSig_CountsPerVolt:  used to convert to Volts.
1022:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  ADC_DelSig_Offset:  Used as the offset while converting ADC counts
